{"name":"-25-10-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG-RuinedCity","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Reverse","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Outside Griffin's extraction point."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Everyone at Griffin! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is our last stand. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Thanks to 416, we all made our way safely back here. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Our defense line remains strong and robust; we're sufficiently armed; we all have the courage to fight for our survival. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The enemy units are immensely powerful - more powerful than the usual PMC. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They attack us relentlessly, fearlessly. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But we have the Commander, flexible tactics, and a wealth of experience. We also have each other, but most importantly, we know why we're here. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"True, they don't fear death, but only we know what it truly means to live. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Say something, too, 416."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"whitescreenOn","value":"0,5","raw":"白屏1"}],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...We made it. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But it wasn't thanks to me, I didn't think I could save you all. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It was the Commander who believed in you. The Commander said we must save all our T-Dolls, and so I did. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't have the right to stand amongst you, but if it's an order, I'll carry it out. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Because only the Commander can lead us to victory, and only in victory do I see the future..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"whitescreenOff","value":"0,5","raw":"白屏2"},{"type":"flash","raw":"闪屏"},{"type":"duration","value":"5","raw":"duration"},{"type":"rate","value":"10","raw":"rate"},{"type":"background","value":"[UMP45(0)&UMP9(0)],[G11(0)],[Cx4Storm(0)&Mk12(0)],[MP40(0)&A91(0)],[9A91(0)&AK74U(0)],[Python(0)]","raw":"Pic"},{"type":"cg","value":"55,55,98,98,99,99","raw":"CG"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"whitescreenOff","value":"0,5","raw":"白屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"BG-RuinedCity","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"}],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(The future... I wonder where it will lead me...)","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MP40","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"MP40","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I believe that as long as the Commander is here, as long as we're all together, we can bear witness to a miracle, a miracle like...all of us standing side by side, right here!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"9A91","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"9A-91","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This time, I want to survive with all my friends."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1928A1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thompson","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...416. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You'll find your answers soon. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"For the sake of our future, follow the Commander to victory!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hahaha! More new parts for me!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can only witness this occasion in my current form...but I'll remind you all not to give up - loudly!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We finally made it back. We can't just fall here!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK74U","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-74U","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"9A-91 and Val are still waiting for me. If I don't grab the MVP title, I'll have to carry everyone's bags again the next time we go shopping."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Mk12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mk 12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"C'mon! It's another step closer to achieving my ambition!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"A91","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"A-91","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I must survive for the sake of my next bottle of vodka."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Python","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"Python","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Now then, prepare for battle!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Five minutes later. The Commander starts laying down the defense line."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK74U","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-74U","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You haven't decided yet, 